WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:04.850
Merriam-Webster's Word of the Year for 2025 was slop.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.330
Before AI, it meant food for pigs.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.850
Now it means digital content of low quality, produced usually in quantity by AI.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:22.530
It's everywhere: for example a deck like every other deck, or a picture with the light a little too golden.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.710
And we all make it too.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.450
Because AI predicts the most likely answer, which is the average of everything online.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:35.650
So when you don't bring your own thinking to AI, you get generic results.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:44.470
And the burden moves to whoever receives it, who has to get through something uninspired, overly long and sometimes downright irrelevant.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:53.890
That's why, in this adventure, we bring back the thinking and teach you to get results from AI that look and sound like you.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:58.790
You created them, and they should deserve the time your audience spends on them.
